SHAH-E-KARBOBALA DUQTAR-E-FATIMA<br>
EK BAHEN TERI EK BETA TERA<br>
JAA RAHA HAI WATAN YE LOOTA QAFELA<br>
<br>
Chodkar Kya Watan Ko Jaye Bahen<br>
Sath Mere Nahi Haye Sheri Suqan<br>
Desaki Na Unhe Bhi Do Gaz Kafan<br>
Jaa Raha Hai Watan Ye Loota Qafela<br>
<br>
Kaisi Shadi Huwi Teri Ibne Hassan<br>
Bewa Dulhan Bani Ujdi Ban Mei Dulhan<br>
Para Para Huwa Ran Mei Sime Badan<br>
Lash Kaisi Mili Jane Mushkil Kusha<br>
<br>
Haye Barchi Ka Phal Aarzu Mitgayi<br>
Umme Laila Garib Hath Malti Rahi<br>
Zainab Qasta Dil Dekti Rehgayi<br>
Shah Ka Kadyal Hawa Samne Chal Basa<br>
<br>
Jab Wantan Jaungi Chain Kya Paungi<br>
Sughra Pouchegi Jab Kaise Samjaungi<br>
Sath Asghar Nahi Kya main Bataungi<br>
Teer Juhi Laga Muskurakar Gaya<br>
<br>
Parcham Haq Utha Daste ghazi Kate<br>
Badh Unke Haram Ban Mei Shahke Lute<br>
Phir Haram Pe Sitam Aur Badte Rahe<br>
Qaime Jalne Lage kurte Bhi Jalae Gaye